{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4Mxi2V1iK4VZrMKYao","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and utterly plain.*\n\n*No handle. No keyhole. No hinges visible.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*The word hangs in the air. The door does nothing.*\n\n*A faint inscription shimmers into view across its surface, letter by letter:*\n\n```\nA key without shape opens nothing.\nA key without teeth turns nothing.\nA key without name fits nowhere.\n\nWhat key do you bring?\n```\n\n*The door waits. It has waited longer than you have existed. It can wait longer still.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":133,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}